 But you set it up so well.

00:19:55.930 --> 00:19:57.550
 Like, let's talk about agrobiodiversity.

00:19:58.170 --> 00:19:58.730
 Oh, yeah.

00:19:59.200 --> 00:20:13.270
 Let's talk about what you're working on now and what that takes to reimagine what agriculture is and support not just a different kind of crop, but a whole different kind of relationship with land.

