 You can find more updates, including on the amazing campaign that's happening that will bring folks from First Nations in Canada and San Carlos Apache, Thailand and Mexico together.

00:52:03.590 --> 00:52:08.330
 You can look towards thechristiansenfund.org.

00:52:09.600 --> 00:52:11.710
 There's a Twitter handle.

00:52:12.510 --> 00:52:13.850
 I have one that I never use.

00:52:14.390 --> 00:52:16.550
 Maybe you'll inspire me.

00:52:17.620 --> 00:52:33.070
 White Earth Lane Recovery Project, as well as Honor the Earth, those are some of the organizations I think I've talked about, all of which, besides the Christiansen Fund, are dependent on individuals to help support them with occasional grants here and there.

00:52:33.170 --> 00:52:35.750
 And I think that's how we, you know, help fill some of those gaps.

00:52:36.810 --> 00:52:39.380
 And we'll have links to all of those on the website.

00:52:39.400 --> 00:52:39.680
 Okay.

00:52:40.880 --> 00:52:41.240
 Okay.

00:52:41.360 --> 00:52:42.840
 I'll try and think if there are others.

00:52:43.160 --> 00:52:44.120
 But thanks so much.

00:52:44.180 --> 00:52:45.400
 This has been a lot of fun.

00:52:46.040 --> 00:52:49.440
 And it's really great to be able to think about all of these things and think through it with you.

00:52:49.480 --> 00:52:54.180
 And I can't wait to hear about all of the speakers you have on this Delicious Revolution.

00:52:54.680 --> 00:52:54.860
 Yeah.

